  <h2>What makes Akeru an open-source Grok Bot alternative?</h2>
  <p>
    Akeru Bot runs named bots through a desktop, web, or mobile client. Each bot can have its own
    instructions, enabled tools, plugins, and long-term memory. The environment server stores the
    chats and settings, and you choose whether that server runs on your computer or in a cloud
    sandbox that you control.
  </p>

